      "content": "A collection Ehrnrooth hopes to write, about humorous or interesting anecdotes of Moonchanters over generations. The title is Lauma's suggestion, and she hopes it will inspire children to study history. Ehrnrooth's first anecdote concerns an earlier Moonchanter who soaked in a lake before ceremonies.",
